      "reviewer": "Marie O",
      "stars": 5,
      "reviewed_at": "2021-10-24T03:35:01.241Z",
      "reaction": "Loved",
      "text": "It was a wonderful surprise , the beef pho had a good flavor ,  and the noodle was very fresh . It was very delicious .\nThe hue rolls and egg rolls were really good .\nOver all , everything was over the top and above all , the representation was nice .",
      "mentioned_items": [
        {
          "item_id": "214088488",
          "text": "hue rolls",
          "in_this_menu": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "reviewer": "Talita R",
      "stars": 5,
      "reviewed_at": "2026-03-26T02:08:49.373Z",
      "reaction": "Loved",
      "text": "They ran out of the 5-spice chicken banh mi and called to inform me, so I ordered the catfish instead. It turned out to be a fortunate choice because it was simply delicious! I loved the fresh bread, and the fish was very flavorful.",
      "mentioned_items": []
    },
    {
      "reviewer": "Briana K",
      "stars": 4,
      "reviewed_at": "2026-01-13T19:57:08.577Z",
      "reaction": "Liked",
      "text": "The 5 spice chicken is incredible and I appreciate the romaine lettuce and pickled veggies in the vermicelli bowl. Huge portions, two meals for the price of one. This is my go-to lunch out!",
      "mentioned_items": []
    },
    {
      "reviewer": "Ziyi G",
      "stars": 1,
      "reviewed_at": "2022-08-24T20:13:28.700Z",
      "reaction": "Didn't like",
      "text": "If you order the clay pot fish, you will get only 1/4 cup of tiny portion with mostly onions. Two bites of food for the price is horrendous. Will not order from this place again",
      "mentioned_items": []
    },
    {
      "reviewer": "Jason L",
      "stars": 5,
      "reviewed_at": "2026-07-22T04:57:11.556Z",
